{"allowed_english": ["Quot"], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}], "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）之间的分离（separated）且有限表示（finite presentation）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>是一个拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0003>-模（module）。则<MATH_0004>是代数空间（algebraic space）。若<MATH_0005>是有限表示（finite presentation）的，则<MATH_0006>是局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）的。参见 Quot，命题<REF_0001>。\n\n", "unit_id": "tag:0DM1:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "态射的源与靶的类型", "source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"context": "态射的分离性条件", "source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"context": "态射及模的有限表示条件", "source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"context": "代数空间之间的映射", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "模的拟凝聚性", "source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"context": "结构层上的模", "source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"context": "Quot 的可表示对象类型", "source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"context": "Quot 的局部有限表示性质", "source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}]}
{"allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角态射"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}], "translation": "<MATH_0001>的对角态射（diagonal）是闭浸入（closed immersion）。若<MATH_0002>是有限型（finite type）的，则该对角态射（diagonal）是有限表示（finite presentation）的闭浸入（closed immersion）。\n", "unit_id": "tag:0DM2:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "Quot 的对角态射", "source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角态射"}, {"context": "对角态射的浸入性质", "source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"context": "模的有限型条件", "source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"context": "闭浸入的有限表示性质", "source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}]}
{"allowed_english": [], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quotients", "target_term": "商"}, {"source_term": "valued points", "target_term": "值点"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "Flatness", "target_term": "空间上的平坦性"}, {"source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角态射"}, {"source_term": "closed immersion", "target_term": "闭浸入"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "Modules on Sites", "target_term": "景上的模"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角态射"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}], "translation": "设有概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>以及两个商（quotients）<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>，它们对应的<MATH_0004>值点（valued points）属于<MATH_0005>，并位于<MATH_0006>之上。记第一个商的核（kernel）为<MATH_0007>，并令<MATH_0008>为复合（composition）。由《空间上的平坦性（Flatness）》，引理<REF_0001>，存在<MATH_0009>的一个闭子空间（closed subspace），使得<MATH_0010>经由它分解当且仅当拉回（pullback）<MATH_0011>为零。这证明了对角态射（diagonal）是闭浸入（closed immersion）。此外，若<MATH_0012>是有限型（finite type）的，则<MATH_0013>是有限型（finite type）的（《景上的模（Modules on Sites）》，引理<REF_0002>），由同一引理可知该对角态射（diagonal）是有限表示（finite presentation）的。\n", "unit_id": "tag:0DM2:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "测试概形", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "对应于 Quot 值点的两个商", "source_term": "quotients", "target_term": "商"}, {"context": "测试概形所取的值点", "source_term": "valued points", "target_term": "值点"}, {"context": "第一个商映射的核", "source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"context": "核到第二个商的复合", "source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"context": "引用章节 Flatness on Spaces", "source_term": "Flatness", "target_term": "空间上的平坦性"}, {"context": "拉回为零所定义的子空间", "source_term": "closed subspace", "target_term": "闭子空间"}, {"context":