{"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商"}, {"source_term": "quotients", "target_term": "商"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "generic fibre", "target_term": "泛纤维"}, {"source_term": "separated", "target_term": "分离"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "quotients", "target_term": "商"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "Properties of Spaces", "target_term": "空间的性质"}], "translation": "作基变换（base change）后，这立即归结为如下问题：给定一个赋值（valuation）环（ring）<MATH_0001>，其分式域（fraction field）为<MATH_0002>，一个代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0003>，它在<MATH_0004>上固有（proper），一个有限型（finite type）的拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0005>-模（module）<MATH_0006>，以及一个凝聚（coherent）商（quotient）<MATH_0007>，证明存在商（quotient）<MATH_0008>，其中<MATH_0009>是有限表示（finitely presented）的<MATH_0010>-模（module），在<MATH_0011>上平坦（flat），其泛纤维（generic fibre）为<MATH_0012>。注意，由《空间上的平坦性（Flatness）》，定理<REF_0001>，任意有限型（finite type）的拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0013>-模（module）<MATH_0014>，若在<MATH_0015>上平坦（flat），则是有限表示（finite presentation）的。我们先在仿射（affine）局部解决<MATH_0016>的存在性问题。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n在仿射（Affine）局部，我们得到如下问题：设<MATH_0017>是有限表示（finitely presented）的环映射（ring map），设<MATH_0018>是有限（finite）<MATH_0019>-模（module），设<MATH_0020>是一个<MATH_0021>-商（quotient）模（module）。则可考虑<MATH_0022>。这里<MATH_0023>是一个<MATH_0024>-模（module）的商（quotient），它作为<MATH_0025>-模（module）是无挠（torsion free）的。因此它作为<MATH_0026>-模（module）是平坦（flat）的（《代数学补充（Algebra）》，引理<REF_0002>）。由于<MATH_0027>作为<MATH_0028>-模（module）是有限（finite）的，<MATH_0029>亦然，于是我们得出<MATH_0030>作为<MATH_0031>-模（module）是有限表示（finite presentation）的（由上述引用）。显然，<MATH_0032>是满足<MATH_0033>的唯一这样的商（quotient）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n上一段构造中的唯一性保证这些商（quotients）可以粘合，给出所需的<MATH_0034>。下面给出更详细的说明。选取满射（surjective）的<ACCENT_0001>平展（étale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0035>，其中<MATH_0036>是仿射概形（affine scheme）。用上述构造得到商（quotient）<MATH_0037>，它是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的，在<MATH_0038>上平坦（flat），且在泛纤维（generic fibre）上恢复<MATH_0039>。由于<MATH_0040>是分离（separated）的，可知<MATH_0041>也是一个仿射概形（affine scheme），且平展（étale）<ACCENT_0002>于<MATH_0042>之上。于是，由构造中的唯一性，<MATH_0043>与<MATH_0044>作为商（quotients）相同。因此可将<MATH_0045>下降为满射（surjection）<MATH_0046>，如所要求的那样（《空间的性质（Properties of Spaces）》，命题<REF_0003>）。\n", "unit_id": "tag:0DM4:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "将存在性归结到赋值环上的操作", "source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"context": "赋值环的限定词", "source_term": "valuation", "target_term": "赋值"}, {"context": "给定的赋值环", "source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"context": "赋值环的分式域", "source_term": "fraction field", "target_term": "分式域"}, {"context": "赋值环上给定的空间", "source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"context": "该空间的固有性", "source_term": "proper", "target_term": "固有"}, {"context": "给定及构造的模的有限型条件", "source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"context": "给定及构造的模的拟凝聚性", "source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"context": "各结构层或环上的模", "source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"context": "泛纤维上给定商的凝聚性", "source_term": "coherent", "target_term": "凝聚"}, {"context": "给定或构造的商", "source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商"}, {"context": "模及环映射的有限表示性", "source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"context": "模在底环或底空间上的平坦性", "source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"context": "分式域上的纤维", "source_term": "generic fibre", "target_term": "泛纤维"}, {"context": "引用章节 Flatness on Spaces", "source_term": "Flatness", "target_term": "空间上的平坦性"}, {"context": "模的有限表示性", "source_term": "finite pre